<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major></Major>
    <Description>(Screen Resoulution 1920 x 1080)

This macro is most effective if you have a Main and Alt Account on the left and right side of the screen (can be edited)
  
The macro can automatically use Replica's ability and makes sure that neither the Main or Alt will get kicked for inactivity.


Note: This macro is used in the game "Slap Battles" by the Slap Battles group made by Ten @Tencell (may be different in the future)

Note2: Both the Main and Alt Accounts may drift from their positions (and the replica ability slightly pushes you when used), so make sure to put them in a position where they won't fall off.</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы 

</Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>2</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>KeyDown 8 1
Delay 50 ms
KeyUp 8 1
Delay 50 ms
LeftDown 1
Delay 64
LeftUp 1
Delay 64
MoveTo 433 421
Delay 64
LeftDown 1
Delay 64
LeftUp 1
Delay 64
MoveTo 1157 486
Delay 64
LeftDown 1
Delay 64
LeftUp 1
Delay 64</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Roblox</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
